  "title": "Where every trace lives · 2026-11-05",
  "description": "Inventory of every agent trace source on Ford's machines on 2026-11-05, with sizes, and the planned path each takes to nas-01. Nothing moves today.\n\n- Top row, tops level: command-center (two subsections \"Backfill only\" 269.9 GB and \"Backfill, then live\" 79.4 GB), services-01 (Backfill job top; Local trace sources; trace-ingest → Raw feed spool → ClickHouse), nas-01 (unreachable today, 8 stores with paths).\n- Bottom row, left to right: dev-01, recording-01, Daytona sandboxes. dev-01 and recording-01 join the green trunk into trace-ingest's left; Daytona's dashed wire enters trace-ingest from below without crossing them.\n- Group and machine wires start on the group frame, because the brief gives each group's flow and total as one path.\n- Backfill job takes \"Backfill only\" from the top, \"Backfill, then live\" from the left and Budget evals from below. Archon's dashed wire enters trace-ingest on top.\n- Notes: key, sources and services-01 notes in a strip under the title; Daytona note at the bottom left.\n- Node colors: blue source, orange at risk now, pink holds a secret, violet collector, teal nas-01 store. Wires: blue backfill, green live, violet dashed waits on Archon fork, gray nightly sqlite copy.",
